+4. **Install Java and DynamoDB Local.** `pnpm dev` starts DynamoDB Local, a local copy of DynamoDB that runs on Java. DynamoDB Local goes in `api/.dynamodb-local/`, which git ignores, and keeps its tables in the `data/` folder there.
